From dfabe2fbe8cc4c026e7c1f703c2f66c6642aa056 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 22:43:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Build-a-Meal feature to calorie tracker

Composes a meal from multiple AI-analysed items (photo or text) and
saves it to a new user_saved_meals table. Saved meals surface under a
new "Saved" tab on the Recent Meals modal for one-tap re-logging.

Reuses existing /analyze-food and /analyze-meal-text endpoints so
analysis logic lives in one place. The builder's photo flow goes
through openCameraWithCallback, and saved-meal quick-logging reuses
saveMealLogWithType from script-11.

Native barcode add-to-builder is intentionally not wired in v1 since
the QuickMealActivity path saves meal_logs directly; it can be added
later without reshaping the builder.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01YJ2nj4Hv3ZYhjKrXLJFLri
